hadiths[57]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2123","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Bani Israil se kaha gaya tha ke tum (bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ke) darwaza mein ruku kartay hue jao aur kaho ” gunaahon ki bakhshish (chahtay hain) tumharay gunah bakhsh diye jayein ge “ lekin Bani Israil ne hukm ke khilaf kiya aur wo darwaza mein sireen ke bal ghisattay hue aaye aur kehnay lagay ke ” baali mein gandum “ (yani hamein gandum chahiye)"
"2124","[AI-translation] ´Ishaq kehtay hain ke` mein ne Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se suna wo kehtay thay ke Ansaar jab Hajj kar ke laut kar aatay to ghar mein (darwazay se) na aatay balke peechay se (deewar par charh kar) aatay aik Ansari aaya aur darwazay se daakhil hua to logon ne us ke baaray mein us se guftagu ki tab ye aayat naazil ke ” ye neki nahi hai ke tum gharon mein peechay se aao balke neki ye hai ke parhezgaari karo aur gharon mein darwazay se aao “"
"2125","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par ye aayat : naazil hui ((lillah ma fi as-samaawaat wa ma fi al-arz ....)) yani ” jo kuch aasmanon aur zameen mein hai sab Allah Taala ke liye hai tum us baat ko zaahir karo jo tumharay dilon mein hai ya chhupaye rakho Allah Taala tum se hisab le le ga phir jis ko chahay ga maaf kar de ga aur jis ko chahay ga azaab de ga aur Allah Taala har cheez par qudrat rakhnay wala hai “ naazil hui to ye aayat sahaba kiraam par bohat hi sakht guzari wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur ghutnon ke bal baith gaye phir kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! (pehle to) ham namaz rozah jihad aur sadqa waghera aisay aamaal ke mukallaf binaye gaye thay (jin par taqat rakhtay thay) aur ab Aap par ye aayat naazil hui hai us ki to ham taqat hi nahi rakhtay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya kiya tum waisi hi baat kehna chahtay ho jaisi tum se pehle do kitabon walon (Yahud o Nasaara) ne kahi thi (yani unhon ne kaha) ” samina o asayna “ ke ham ne (Allah aur Rasoolullah ki baat ko) sun to liya hai lekin maantay nahi hain balke Aap logon ko yun kehna chahiye ke ham ne (Allah ki aur Rasoolullah ki baat ko) sun liya aur maan liya Ae hamaray Rab ham teri bakhshish chahtay hain aur hamari wapasi teri taraf hai to sahaba kiraam ne yehi kaha ke ham ne sun liya aur maan liya ham apne gunaahon ki maafi chahtay hain Ae hamaray Rab ! aur teri hi taraf wapasi hai jab sahaba kiraam ne us ko padhna shuru kiya to us ke padhnay se un ki zubaanon ko sahoolat hui to Allah Taala ne ye aayaat naazil kein ((aamanar ar-rasool bima unzil ilaih ....)) yani ” Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us (shariat) ke saath iman laaye jo un ke Rab ki taraf se un par naazil ki gayi aur momin log bhi iman laaye aur sab ke sab iman laaye Allah Taala ke saath aur us ke farishton aur us ki kitabon aur us ke Rasoolullahon ke saath (sab ke sab kehtay hain) ke ham Allah ke Rasoolullahon ke darmiyan farq nahi kartay (sab Rasoolullahon ko maantay hain ye nahi ke kisi Rasoolullah ko manein aur kisi ko na manein) aur unhon ne kaha ke ham ne suna aur maan liya Ae hamaray Rab ! ham teri bakhshish chahtay hain aur teri hi taraf wapasi hai “ jab sahaba kiraam ne ye kiya (yani un aayaat ko padha aur sache dil se padha) to Allah Taala ne aayat ((wa in tubdu ma fi anfusakum ....)) aayat ko mansookh kar diya aur aayat ((la yukallif Allah nafsan....)) utaar di yani ” Allah Taala kisi nafs ko us ki taqat se zyada takleef mein nahi daalta us (nafs) ke liye wo hai jo us ne kamaya aur us ke khilaf bhi wohi kuch ho ga jo us ne kamaya Ae hamaray Rab ! ham par waisa bojh na rakhna jaisa ke ham se pehle walon par rakha tha to Allah ne farmaya ” haan “ Ae hamaray Rab ! ham se wo bojh na uthwana jis ki ham mein uthanay ki taqat na ho to Allah ne farmaya ” haan “ aur hamein maaf kar de hamein bakhsh de ham par rehem kar to hamara dost ya Maalik hai pas to kafir qaum par hamari madad farma to Allah Taala ne farmaya ” haan “"
"2126","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye aayat padhi ke ” Allah Taala wo hai jis ne tujh par kitab utari us mein baaz aayaat mazboot (muhkam) hain wo to kitab ki jar hain aur baaz mutashaabeh (yani gol maul ya chhupe matlab ki) phir jin logon ke dil mein gumrahi hai wo mutashaabeh aayaton ka khoj kartay hain aur fasaad chahtay hain aur us ka matlab chahtay hain halanke us ka matlab Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta aur jo pake ilm walay hain wo kehtay hain ke ham us par iman laaye sab aayaat hamaray Rab ke paas se aayi hain aur nasihat wohi suntay hain jo aqal rakhtay hain “ Umm ul-Momineen kehti hain ke (tilawat ke baad) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab tum un logon ko dekho jo mutashaabeh aayaat ka khoj kartay hain to un se bacho ke wohi log hain jin ka Allah Taala ne (Quran mein) naam liya hai (yani un ke dilon mein kaji hai us liye iman walon ko aisay logon se bachna chaahiye)"
"2127","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` kuch munafiq Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ehad mubarak mein aisay thay ke jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam larai par jatay to wo peechay reh jatay aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay ghar mein baithnay se khush hotay phir jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam laut kar aatay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se uzr kartay aur qasam khatay aur chahtay ke log un ki un kaamon par tareef karein jo unhon ne nahi kiye tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke ” mat gumaan karo un logon ko jo apne kiye se khush hotay hain aur chahtay hain ke un ki aisay kaamon par tareef ki jaye jo unhon ne nahi kiye pas un ke baara mein ye gumaan hargiz na karo ke ye azaab se chhutkaara payein ge un ko dukh ki maar hai “"
"2128","[AI-translation] ´Humaid bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai ke` Marwan ne apne darbaan Rafi se kaha ke bin Abbas raziyallahu anhuma ke paas ja aur keh ke agar ham mein se har us aadmi ko azaab ho jo apne kiye par khush hota hai aur chahta hai ke log us ki us baat par tareef karein jo us ne nahi ki phir to ham sab ko azaab ho ga (kyunke ham sab mein ye aib maujood hai) to Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke tumhein us aayat se kiya ta'alluq hai ye aayat to ahl kitab ke haq mein naazil hai phir Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne ye aayat ((wa iz akhaza Allah ....)) aakhir tak padhi aur phir ((la tahsabanna allazina ....)) aayat padhi Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ahl kitab se koi baat poochi to unhon ne us ko chhupaya aur us ke badlay doosri baat butayi phir us haal mein niklay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye samajhaya ke ham ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko wo baat bata di jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poochi thi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se apni tareef ke talabgaar hue aur dil mein apne kiye par khush hue (yani apni asal baat ke chhupanay par jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un se poochi thi to Allah Taala unhein ko farmata hai ke un ko azaab ho ga aur muraad wohi ahl kitab hain)"
"2129","[AI-translation] ´Urwa bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Allah Subhaanahu wa Taala ke us farman ” agar tum daro ke yateem larkion mein insaaf na kar sako ge to un auraton se nikah karo jo tumhein pasand aayein do do se aur teen teen se aur chaar chaar se “ ke baaray mein poocha to unhon ne kaha ke Ae mere bhaanjay ! us aayat se muraad wo yateem larki hai jo apne wali ki god mein ho (yani parwarish mein jaisay chacha ki larki bhatijay ke paas ho) aur us ke maal mein shareek ho (masalan chacha ke maal mein) phir us wali ko us ka maal aur Hasan o jamaal pasand aaye aur wo us se nikah karna chahay lekin us ke mahar mein insaaf na karay aur itna mahar na de jo aur log denay ko mustaed hun to Allah Taala ne aisi larkion ke saath nikah karnay se mana kiya hai magar us soorat mein (nikah karna jaaiz hai) jab wo insaaf karein aur mahar poora denay par raazi hun aur un ko hukm kiya ke (un ke ilawa) doosri auraton se nikah karein jo un ko pasand aayein Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke logon ne ye aayat utarnay ke baad phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se un larkion ke baaray mein poocha to Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke ” tujh se auraton ke baaray mein poochtay hain to tum kaho ke Allah Taala tumhein un ke baaray mein hukm deta hai aur jo kitab mein un yateem auraton ke haq ke baaray mein padha jata hai jin ka mahar muqarrar tum nahi detay aur un se nikah karna chahtay ho “ Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke ye jo Allah Taala ne zikr farmaya tha ke ” agar tumhein us baat ka khadsha ho ke yateemon ke baaray mein insaaf nahi kar sako ge to (un ke ilawa) jo aurtein tumhein pasand hun un se nikah kar lo aur Umm ul-Momineen raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke Allah Taala ke farman doosri aayat mein ” aur tum raghbat rakhtay ho un se nikah ki “ se muraad tum mein se kisi aik ka us yateem larki se jo ke tumhari zair parwarish ho aur maal aur Hasan o jamaal mein kam ho nikah na karnay ka irada muraad hai pas unhein us yateem aurat se jo ke maal wali aur Hasan o jamaal wali ho nikah karnay se mana kar diya gaya magar us soorat mein ke jab insaaf karein (yani un ka haq mahar un aur un ka maal waghera un ko poora dein) (us ka mafhoom ye hai ke shuru mein chunke log aisa kartay thay ke wo us yateem larki se jo un ke zair parwarish hoti thi aur maaldaar aur haseen o Jameel hoti thi to khud hi un se nikah kar letay lekin un ke maal mein khayanat kartay aur mahar bhi poora na detay us soorat mein surat ke shuru wali aayat mein unhein un se nikah karnay se mana kar diya lekin jab sahaba kiraam ne un ke saath khud nikah karnay mein un ke liye behtari ki soorat mein un se nikah karnay ke baara mein poocha to Allah Taala ne Surah Nisa ki doosri aayat number 127 naazil farmayi ke insaaf ke saath nikah karna chaho to jaaiz aur ahsan iqdaam hai)"
"2130","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se` us aayat ” jo shakhs maaldaar ho wo bacha rahay (aur jo mohtaaj ho wo apni zaroorat ke muwafiq khaye) “ ke baara mein marwi hai ke ye aayat us shakhs ke baaray mein naazil hai jo yateem ke maal ka mutawalli ho aur us ko durust karay aur sanwaare to agar wo mohtaaj ho to dastoor ke muwafiq khaye (aur jo maaldaar ho to kuch na khaye)"
"2131","[AI-translation] ´Zaid bin Sabit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jang Uhud ke liye niklay aur jo log Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay un mein se kuch aadmi laut aaye (wo munafiq thay aur wo teen sau ke qareeb thay) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab un ke muqadma mein do farqe ho gaye baaz kehnay lagay ke ham un ko qatl karein ge aur baaz ne kaha ke nahi ! qatl nahi karein ge tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke ” tumhara kiya haal hai ke tum munafiqon ke baaray mein do farqe ho gaye ho “"
"2132","[AI-translation] ´Sa'eed bin Jubair kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke jo koi momin ko jaan bojh kar qatl karay us ki tauba ho sakti hai Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke nahi mein ne un ko ye aayat sunayi jo Surah Furqan mein hai ke ((o lillazeen la yad'oon ....)) aakhir tak jis ke baad ye hai ke ((la Nabi taab ....)) (kyunke us se ye nikalta hai ke naahaq khoon ke baad tauba kar sakta hai) “ Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke ye aayat Makki hai aur us ko us aayat ne mansookh kar diya hai jo Madina mein naazil ke ” jo koi momin ko amdan qatl karay us ka badla jahannam hai aur wo hamesha us mein rahay ga “"
"2133","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Musalmanon ke kuch logon ne aik shakhs ko thori bakriyon mein dekha wo bola ke salam alaikum Musalmanon ne us ko pakra aur qatl kar ke wo bakriyan le lein tab ye aayat naazil ke ” mat kaho us ko jo tumhein salam karay ke to Musalman nahi hai (balke apni jaan bachanay ke liye salam karta hai) “ Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne us aayat mein ((salam)) padha hai aur baaz ne ((salam)) padha hai (to maani ye hun ge jo tum se sulah se pesh aaye)"
"2134","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne` us aayat ke baaray mein ” aur agar kisi aurat ko apne shohar ki taraf se badsulooki ya berukhi ka khatra ho (to un donon par koi haraj nahi ke wo aapas mein { koi baat tay kar ke } sulah kar lein ....) kaha ke ye aayat us aurat ke baaray mein naazil jo aik shakhs ke paas ho ab wo zyada us ko apne paas na rakhna chahay lekin us aurat ki aulad ho aur sohbat ho apne shohar se aur wo apne shohar ko chhorna bura janay to us ko apne baaray mein ijazat de (yani apna haq zaujiat chhor de)"
"2135","[AI-translation] ´Taariq bin Shihab kehtay hain ke` aik Yahudi Umar raziyallahu anhu ke paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae Ameer-ul-Momineen ! tumhari kitab mein aik aayat hai jis ko tum padhtay ho agar wo ham Yahudiyon par utarti to ham us din ko Eid kar letay Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke kaun si aayat wo Yahudi bola ke ” aaj ke din mein ne tumharay liye tumharay deen ko mukammal kar diya hai aur apni nemat tum par tamam kar di hai aur tumharay liye Islam ko (bataur) deen pasand kar liya hai “ Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein us din ko janta hun jis din ye aayat naazil aur us muqaam ko bhi janta hun jis muqaam par ye aayat naazil ye aayat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par muqaam Arafaat mein Juma ke din naazil (aur wo din Musalmanon ke liye do Eidon ka majmoo tha aik to Juma ka din aur doosra Arafa ka din)"
"2136","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab ye aayat ” jo log iman laaye phir unhon ne apne iman ke saath zulm nahi kiya (yani gunah mein na phansay) un ko aman hai aur wohi raah paanay walay hain “ naazil to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba kiraam par bohat mushkil guzari unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham mein se kaun sa aisa hai jo apne nafs par zulm (yani gunah) nahi karta Chunanche Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us aayat ka ye matlab nahi jaisa tum khayal kartay ho balke zulm se muraad wo hai jo Luqman alaihissalam ne apne betay se kaha tha ke ” Ae mere betay ! Allah ke saath shirk mat kar beshak shirk bara zulm hai “ (Luqman : 13)"
"2137","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : teen baatein jab zaahir ho jayein to ” us waqt kisi ko iman lanay se faida na ho ga jo pehle se iman na laya ho ya naik kaam na kiya ho “ aik to sooraj ka us taraf se nikalna jis taraf gharoob hota hai doosray Dajjal ka nikalna aur teesray zameen ke janwar ka nikalna"
"2138","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik din apne sahaba se farmaya : tum jantay ho ke ye sooraj kahan jata hai unhon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye chalta rehta hai yahan tak ke apne theharnay ki jagah par arsh ke neechay aata hai wahan sajda mein gir jata hai (us sajda ka mafhoom Allah Taala hi janta hai) phir usi haal mein rehta hai yahan tak ke us ko hukm hota hai ke ooncha ho ja aur ja jahan se aaya hai to wo laut aata hai aur apne nikalnay ki jagah se nikalta hai phir chalta rehta hai yahan tak ke apne theharnay ki jagah par arsh ke neechay aata hai aur sajda karta hai phir usi haal mein rehta hai yahan tak ke us se kaha jata hai ke ooncha ho ja aur laut ja jahan se aaya hai wo phir apne nikalnay ki jagah se nikalta hai aur phir usi tarah chalta hai aik baar usi tarah chalay ga aur logon ko us ki chaal mein koi farq mehsoos na ho ga yahan tak ke apne theharnay ki jagah par arsh ke neechay aaye ga us waqt us se kaha jaye ga ke ooncha ho ja aur Maghrib ki taraf se nikal jidhar to gharoob hota hai to wo Maghrib ki taraf se niklay ga phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum jantay ho ke ye kab ho ga (yani sooraj ka Maghrib ki taraf se nikalna) ye us waqt ho ga ” jab kisi ko iman lana faida na de ga jo pehle se iman na laya ho ya us ne apne iman mein naik kaam na kiye hun “"
"2139","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` aurat (jahiliyat ke zamana mein) khana Kaaba ka tawaaf nangi ho kar karti aur kehti ke kaun mujhe aik kapra deta hai ke wo usay apni sharmgah par daal le aur kehti ke aaj khul jaye ga sab ya baaz phir jo khul jaye ga us ko kabhi halal na karun gi (yani wo hamesha ke liye haraam ho gaya ye behooda rasm Islam ne khatm kar di) tab ye aayat naazil ke ” har masjid ke paas apne kapray pehan kar jao “"
"2140","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) aur Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aik pukaarnay wala (jannat ke logon ko) pukaaray ga ke tumharay wastay ye thehar chuka ke tum tandurust raho ge kabhi beemar na ho ge aur yaqeenan tum zinda raho ge kabhi na maro ge aur yaqeenan tum jawan raho ge kabhi boorhay na ho ge aur yaqeenan tum aish aur chain mein raho ge kabhi ranj na ho ga aur yehi matlab hai Allah Taala ke us qaul ka ke ” jannat walay aawaz diye jayein ge ke ye tumhari jannat hai jis ke tum waris hue us wajah se ke tum naik aamaal kartay thay “"
"2141","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Jahl la'een ne kaha ke ” Ae Allah ! agar ye Quran sach hai aur teri taraf se hai to ham par aasmaan se pathar barsa ya dukh ka azaab bhej “ us waqt ye aayat naazil ke ” Allah Taala un ko azaab karnay wala nahi hai jab tak (Ae Nabi) to un mein maujood hai aur Allah Taala un ko azaab karnay wala nahi hai jab tak wo istighfar kartay hain aur kiya hua jo Allah azaab na karay un ko halanke wo Masjid-ul-Haram mein aanay se roktay hain ........ “ aakhir tak"
"2142","[AI-translation] ´Sa'eed bin Jubair kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke Surah Tauba unhon ne kaha ke Surah Tauba aur kaha ke balke wo surat to zaleel karnay wali hai aur fazeehat karnay wali hai (kafiron aur munafiqon ki) us surat mein barabar utarta raha ke ” aur un mein se “ ” aur un mein se “ yahan tak ke munafiq log samjhay ke koi baaqi na rahay ga jis ka zikr us surat mein na kiya jaye ga mein ne kaha ke Surah al-Anfaal unhon ne kaha ke wo surat to Badr ki larai ke baaray mein hai (us mein maal ghaneemat ke ehkaam mazkoor hain) mein ne kaha ke Surah Hashr unhon ne kaha ke wo Bani Nazeer ke baaray mein naazil"
"2143","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` aik aadmi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein ne Madina ke kinaaray mein ne aik aurat se maza uthaya aur mein ne sab baatein kein siwae jima ke ab mein haazir hun jo chahay mere baaray mein hukm dijiye Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Allah ne tere gunah par parda daal rakha tha to bhi agar parda daalay rakhta to behtar hota Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne usay kuch jawab na diya tab wo shakhs khara hua aur chal para Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ke peechay aik shakhs ko bheja aur bila kar ye aayat padhi : ((un al-hasanaat yuzhibna ....)) aik shakhs bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ye hukm khaas usi ke liye hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi balke sab ke liye hai"
"2144","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath aik khait mein ja raha tha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik lakri par taika diye hue thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Yahud ke aik giroh ke paas se guzray un mein se aik ne doosray se kaha ke un se rooh ke baaray mein poocho doosray ne kaha ke tumhein kiya shubha hai jo poochtay ho aisa na ho ke wo koi aisi baat kahein jo tumhein buri maloom ho phir unhon ne kaha ke poocho aakhir un mein se kuch log uthay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf aaye aur rooh ke baaray mein poocha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khamosh ho rahay aur kuch jawab na diya mein samjha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi aa rahi hai kehtay hain ke mein usi jagah khara raha jab wahi utar chuki to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye aayat padhi ke ” tujh se rooh ke baaray mein poochtay hain to keh do ke rooh mere Rab ka aik hukm hai aur tum ilm nahi diye gaye magar thora “"
"2145","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se` us aayat ” jin ko ye log pukaartay hain wo to apne Maalik ke paas waseela dhoondtay hain “ ke mutaliq riwayat hai ke baaz aadmi chand jinon ki pooja kartay thay wo jin Musalman ho gaye (aur un ke poojnay walon ko khabar na hui) aur wo log un ko hi poojtay rahay tab ye aayat naazil ke ” wo jin ki ye log pooja kartay hain wo to apne Maalik ke paas waseela dhoondtay hain “"
"2146","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) us` aayat ” tum apni namaz ko na zyada oonchi aawaz mein padho aur na bilkul hi aahista balke mutawassit tareeqa ikhtiyar karo “ ke baaray mein kehtay hain ke ye Makka Mukarrama mein us waqt naazil hui jab ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khauf ki wajah se aik ghar mein posheeda thay waqia ye hai jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sahaba ko namaz padhatay to Quran ba-aawaaz buland padhtay pas jab ke mushrik Quran Kareem ki aawaz suntay to Quran Kareem us ko naazil karnay walay (yani Allah Taala) aur jis par naazil hua (yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko gaaliaan detay us par Allah Taala ne apne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se farmaya ke ” Aap itnay zor se namaz (mein Quran) na padhein “ ke jisay mushrik sun sakein ” aur itnay aahista bhi na (Quran) padhein “ ke Aap ke ashaab bhi na sun sakein ” balke darmiyani aawaz mein (Quran) padhye “ aahista aur oonchi aawaz ke darmiyan darmiyan"
"2147","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Allah Taala ke us` farman ((wa la tajhar bisalaatik....)) ke mutaliq kehti hain ke ye dua ke baaray naazil hui (yani dua na bohat zor se maango aur na bohat aahista aawaz mein)"
"2148","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat ke din bara mota aadmi aaye ga jo Allah ke qareeb machhar ke aik par ke barabar bhi na ho ga ye aayat padho ke ” ham qayamat ke din un ke liye koi wazan na rakhein ge “ (yani duniya ka motapa aur maal aur daulat qayamat mein kaam nahi aaye ga wahan to amal darkaar hai us hadees se motapay ki mazammat saabit hui)"
"2149","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat ke din maut aik safed maindhay ki shakal mein layi jaye gi aur us ko dozakh aur jannat ke darmiyan mein thehra diya jaye ga phir kaha jaye ga ke Ae jannat walo ! kiya tum us ko pehchantay ho wo apna sar utha kar kahein ge aur us ko dekhein ge aur kahein ge ke haan ! ham pehchantay hain ye maut hai phir kaha jaye ga ke Ae dozakh walo ! kiya tum us ko pehchantay ho wo bhi sar utha kar us ko dekhein ge aur kahein ge ke haan ! ham us ko pehchantay hain ye maut hai phir hukm ho ga to wo maindha zabah kiya jaye ga phir kaha jaye ga ke Ae jannat walo ! tumhein hamesha rehna hai aur kabhi maut nahi hai aur Ae dozakh walo ! tumhein bhi hamesha zinda rehna hai aur tumharay liye bhi kabhi maut nahi hai phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye aayat padhi ” aur un ko hasrat ke din se darao jab faisla ho jaye ga aur wo ghaflat mein hain aur yaqeen nahi kartay “ Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne haath se duniya ki taraf ishara kiya (yani duniya mein aisay mashghool hain ke qayamat ka darr nahi hai)"
"2150","[AI-translation] ´Khabbaab raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Aas bin Wail par mera qarz tha mein us se lenay ko gaya to wo bola ke mein kabhi na dun ga jab tak to Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (ke deen) se phir na jaye ga mein ne kaha ke mein to Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se us waqt bhi na phiron ga ke to mar kar ji uthay wo bola ke mein marnay ke baad phir uthon ga to tera qarz ada karun ga tab ye aayat naazil ” to ne us shakhs ko dekha jis ne hamari aayaton ka inkar kiya aur kehnay laga ke mujhe maal aur aulad milay gi kiya wo ghaib ki baat ko janta hai ya us ne Allah Taala se koi iqraar kiya hai ........ “ aakhir tak"
"2151","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamaray darmiyan khutba padhnay ko kharay hue to farmaya ke Ae logon ! tum Allah ki taraf nangay paon bin khatna kiye ikathay kiye jao ge ” jaisay ham ne awwal baar paida kiya waisa hi dobara paida karein ge ye hamara waada hai jis ko ham karnay walay hain “ (104) khabardaar raho ! tamam makhlooqat mein sab se pehle Ibrahim alaihissalam ko qayamat ke din kapray pehanaye jayein ge aur aagaah raho ke meri ummat ke kuch log laaye jayein ge phir un ko baayein (kafiron ki) taraf hata diya jaye ga mein kahun ga ke Ae mere Maalik ! ye to mere maannay walay hain jawab mein kaha jaye ga ke tum nahi jantay ke unhon ne tumharay baad kiya naye kaam kiye pas mein wohi kahun ga jo naik banday (Isa alaihissalam) ne kaha ke ” mein to un logon par us waqt tak gawah tha jab tak un mein maujood tha phir jab to ne mujhe utha liya to to un par nigehbaan tha (aur mujhe un ka ilm na raha) aur to har cheez par gawah hai (yani tera ilm sab jagah hai) agar to un ko azaab karay to wo tere banday hain aur agar to un ko bakhsh de to to ghalib hikmat wala hai “ (Maaida : 117-118) phir mujh se kaha jaye ga ke tumharay juda honay ke baad ye log murtad ho gaye yani deen se phir gaye"
"2152","[AI-translation] ´Qais bin Ubaad kehtay hain ke` mein ne Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se suna wo (Surah Hajj ki us aayat ke mutaliq) qasam khatay thay ke ” yani ye donon giroh aik doosray ke dushman hain jo apne Rab ke baaray mein lartay hain “ beshak ye un logon ke haq mein naazil hai jo Badr ke din Musalmanon ki taraf se (saf se) larnay ke liye bahar niklay thay Sayyid-ush-shuhada Hamza Ali Murtaza aur Ubaida bin Haris raziyallahu anhuma aur kafiron ki taraf se Utba aur Shaiba donon Rabia ke betay aur Waleed bin Utba"
"2153","[AI-translation] ´Zuhri kehtay hain ke` mujh se Sa'eed bin Musayyab Urwa bin Zubair Alqama bin Waqqas aur Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Mas'ud ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ki ye hadees riwayat ki jab un par tohmat laganay walon ne tohmat lagayi aur kaha jo kaha phir Allah Taala ne un ko un ki tohmat se paak kiya Zuhri ne kaha ke un sab logon ne mujh se us hadees ka aik aik tukra riwayat kiya aur un mein se baaz doosron se us hadees ko zyada yaad rakhnay walay thay aur zyada haafiz aur umda bayan karnay walay thay aur mein ne har aik se jo us ne riwayat ki yaad rakha aur baaz ki hadees baaz ki tasdeeq karti hai un logon ne bayan kiya ke Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab safar ka irada kartay to apni azwaaj mutahharat ke darmiyan qura daaltay aur jis aurat ke naam par qura nikalta us ko safar mein saath le jatay thay Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jihad ke aik safar mein qura daalnay to us mein mera naam nikla mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath gayi aur ye us waqt ka zikr hai jab parda ka hukm utar chuka tha mein apne haudaj mein sawaar hoti aur raah mein jab parao hota to mera haudaj utaar liya jata jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jihad se farigh ho kar lautay aur Madina se qareeb ho gaye to aik baar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne raat ko kooch ka hukm diya jab logon ne kooch ki khabar kar di to mein khari hui aur chali yahan tak ke lashkar se aik taraf chali gayi jab mein apni zaroorat se farigh hui to apne haudaj ki taraf aayi aur seena ko chhua to maloom hua ke mera Zafaar ke nageenon ka haar ghum ho gaya hai (Zafaar Yaman mein aik gaon ka naam hai) mein lauti aur us haar ko dhoondhnay lagi us ke dhoondnay mein mujhe dair lagi aur wo log aa pahunche jo mera hauda uthatay thay unhon ne hauda uthaya aur us oont par rakh diya jis par mein sawaar hoti thi aur wo ye samjhay ke mein usi hauday mein hun us waqt aurtein halki (dubli) hoti thin kyunke thora khana khati thin us liye jab unhon ne haudaj utha kar oont par rakha to unhein us ka wazan halka mehsoos na hua mein waisay bhi aik kam sun larki thi aakhir logon ne oont ko uthaya aur chal diye mein ne apna haar us waqt paya jab saara lashkar chal diya tha aur mein jo un ke thikanay par aayi to wahan na kisi ki aawaz thi aur na koi aawaz sun-nay wala tha mein ne ye irada kiya ke jahan baithi thi wahein baith jaun aur mein samajhi ke log jab mujhe na payein ge to yeein laut kar aayein ge to mein usi thikanay par baithi thi ke meri aankh lag gayi aur mein sau rahi aur Safwan bin Mu'attal Salmi Zakwaani raziyallahu anhu aik aadmi jo ke aaraam ke liye aakhir raat mein lashkar ke peechay thehray thay jab wo rawana hue to subah ko mere thikanay par pahunche un ko aik aadmi ka jism maloom hua jo sau raha ho wo mere paas aaya aur mujhe dekhtay hi pehchan liya kyunke parda ka hukm utarnay se pehle us ne mujhe dekha tha mein un ki aawaz sun kar jaag uthi jab us ne mujhe pehchan kar ((inna lillah wa inna ilaih raji'oon)) padha pas mein ne apni orhni se apna munh dhaanp liya Allah ki qasam ! us ne mujh se koi baat nahi ki aur na mein ne us ki koi baat siwae ” inna lillah wa inna ilaih raji'oon “ kehnay ke suni phir us ne apna oont bithaya aur oont ke ghutnay par apna paon mere sawaar honay ke liye rakha mein oont par sawaar ho gayi aur wo oont ko kheenchta hua paidal chala yahan tak ke ham lashkar mein pahunche aur lashkar ke log dopahar ki sakht garmi mein utar chukay thay sau mere us muamla mein badgumaani ki wajah se halaak hue jo hue aur Quran mein jis ke mutaliq ” tawalla kubra “ aaya hai yani us tohmat ka baani mubaani wo Abdullah bin Abu bin Salol (munafiqon ka sardar) tha aakhir ham Madina mein aaye aur jab mein Madina mein pahunchi to beemar ho gayi aik maheena tak beemar rahi aur logon ka ye haal tha ke buhtaan laganay walon ki baaton mein ghaur kartay thay aur mujhe un ki kisi baat ki koi khabar na thi sirf mujhe us baat se shak hua ke mein ne apni beemari mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wo shafqat na dekhi jo pehle meri beemari ki haalat mein hoti thi us dauran Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sirf andar aatay salam kartay aur phir farmatay ke tumhara kiya haal hai pas us baat se mujhe shak hota lekin mujhe us kharaabi ki khabar na thi yahan tak ke jab mein beemari ke janay ke baad dubli ho gayi to mein Manaase ki taraf nikli aur mere saath Umm Mistah bhi nikli (Manaase Madina ke bahar jagah thi) logon ke (paikhanay binnay se pehle) paikhanay thay phir doosri raat ko jatay thay ye zikr us waqt ka hai jab hamaray gharon mein paikhanay nahi banay thay aur ham log aglay Arabon ki tarah (paikhanay ke liye) jungle mein jaya kartay thay aur ghar ke paas paikhanay bananay se nafrat rakhtay thay to mein chali aur Umm Mistah bhi mere saath thi aur wo Abu Rahm bin matlab bin Abd-e-Manaaf ki beti thi aur us ki maan Sakhr bin Amir ki beti thi jo Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ki khala thi (us ka naam Salma tha) us ke betay ka naam Mistah bin asaasa bin Ubaad bin matlab tha gharz mein aur Umm Mistah donon jab qaza-e haajat se farigh ho chukein to wapasi par apne ghar ki taraf aa rahi thin ke Umm Mistah ka paon apni chaadar mein uljha to wo boli ke Mistah halaak ho mein ne kaha ke to ne buri baat kahi to us shakhs ko bura kehti hai jo Badr ki larai mein shareek tha wo boli ke Ae naadaan ! to ne kuch nahi suna ke Mistah ne kiya kaha mein ne kaha ke us ne kiya kaha us ne mujh se bayan kiya jo buhtaan walon ne kaha tha ye sun kar meri beemari zyada ho gayi mein jab apne ghar pahunchi to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam andar tashreef laaye aur salam kiya aur farmaya ke tumhara kiya haal hai mein ne kaha ke Aap mujhe apne maan baap ke paas janay ki ijazat detay hain aur mera us waqt ye irada tha ke mein apne maan baap ke paas ja kar us khabar ki tasdeeq karun gi aakhir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe ijazat di aur mein apne maan baap ke paas aayi mein ne apni maan se kaha ke Ummi jaan ! ye log kiya bik rahay hain wo boli ke beta to us ka khayal na kar aur us ko bari baat mat samajh Allah ki qasam ! aisa bohat kam hua hai ke kisi mard ke paas aik khoobsurat aurat ho jo us ko chahta ho aur us ki sauknein bhi hun aur sauknein us ke aib na nikaalein mein ne kaha ke SubhanAllah Allah ! logon ne to ye kehna shuru kar diya mein saari raat roti rahi subah tak mere aansu na thehray aur na neend aayi subah ko bhi mein ro rahi thi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ali bin Abu Talib aur Usama bin Zaid ko bulaya kyunke wahi nahi naazil thi aur un donon se mujhe juda karnay (yani talaqein denay) ka mashwara liya aur Usama bin Zaid raziyallahu anhu ne to wohi raye di jo wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki biwi ke haal ko jantay thay aur us ki ismat ko aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki us ke saath mohabbat ko unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki biwi hain aur ham to un ki siwae behtari ke aur koi baat nahi jantay Ali raziyallahu anhu bin Abu Talib ne kaha ke Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par tangi nahi ki aur Aisha raziyallahu anha ke siwa aurtein bohat hain aur agar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam londi se poochein to wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sach keh de gi (londi se muraad Buraira raziyallahu anha hai jo Aisha raziyallahu anha ke paas rehti thi) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Buraira ko bulaya aur farmaya ke Ae Buraira ! to ne kabhi Aisha se aisi baat dekhi hai jis se tujhe us ki paakdaamni par shak paray Buraira ne kaha ke qasam us ki jis ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko sacha paighambar kar ke bheja hai agar mein un ka koi kaam dekhti to mein aib bayan karti us se zyada koi aib nahi hai ke Aisha kam Umar larki hai ghar ka aata chhor kar sau jati hai phir bakri aati hai aur us ko kha leti hai (matlab ye hai ke un mein koi aib nahi jis ko tum poochtay ho na us ke siwa koi aib hai jo aib hai wo yehi hai ke bhooli bhaali larki hai aur kam Umari ki wajah se ghar ka bandobast nahi kar sakti) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mimbar par kharay hue aur Abdullah bin Abu bin Salol se jawab talab kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mimbar par farmaya ke Ae Musalman logon ! us shakhs se mujhe kaun insaaf dilaye ga jis ki eeza denay wali sakht baat mere ghar walon ki nisbat mujh tak pahunchi Allah ki qasam ! mein to apni ghar wali (yani Aisha Siddiqa raziyallahu anha) ko naik samajhta hun aur jis shakhs par ye tohmat lagatay hain (yani Safwan bin Mu'attal) us ko bhi mein naik samajhta hun aur wo kabhi mere ghar nahi gaya magar mere saath ye sun kar Sa'd bin Muaz Ansari raziyallahu anhu (jo qabeela Aus ke sardar thay) kharay hue aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka badla leta hun agar tohmat karnay wala hamari qaum Aus mein se ho to ham us ki gardan maartay hain aur jo hamaray Khazraj bhaiyon mein se ho to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hukm kijiye ham Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke hukm ki ta'meel karein ge (yani us ki gardan maarein ge) ye sun kar Sa'd bin Ubada raziyallahu anhu kharay hue aur wo qabeela Khazraj ke sardar thay aur naik aadmi thay lekin us waqt un ko apni qaum ki ghairat aa gayi aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Sa'd bin Muaz ! Allah ke baqa ki qasam ! to ne jhoot bola hai to hamari qaum ke shakhs ko qatl na kar sakay ga (ye sun kar) Usaid bin Huzair jo Sa'd bin Muaz raziyallahu anhu ke chachazaad bhai thay kharay hue aur Sa'd bin Ubada raziyallahu anhu se kehnay lagay ke to ne ghalat kaha Allah ke baqa ki qasam ! ham us ko qatl karein ge aur to munafiq hai jabhi to munafiqon ki taraf se larta hai gharz ke donon qabeelay Aus aur Khazraj ke log uth kharay hue aur qareeb tha ke khoonraizi shuru ho jati ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mimbar par kharay un ko samjha rahay thay aur un ka ghussa thanda kar rahay thay yahan tak ke wo khamosh ho gaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi khamosh ho rahay Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke mein us din bhi saara din roti rahi mere aansu nahi thamtay thay aur na neend aati thi aur mere baap ne ye gumaan kiya ke rotay rotay mera kalaiji phat jaye ga mere maan baap mere paas baithay thay aur mein ro rahi thi itnay mein Ansaar ki aik aurat ne ijazat maangi mein ne us ko ijazat di wo bhi aa kar ronay lagi phir ham usi haal mein thay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye aur salam kar ke baith gaye aur jis roz se mujh par tohmat hui thi us roz se aaj tak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere paas nahi baithay thay aur aik maheena yunhi guzar chuka tha ke mere muqadma mein koi wahi nahi naazil thi Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne baithtay hi tashahhud padha aur farmaya ke amma baad ! Ae Aisha mujhe tumhari taraf se aisi aisi khabar pahunchi hai phir agar tum paakdaaman ho to anqareeb Allah Taala tumhari paakdaamni bayan kar de ga aur agar to ne gunah kiya hai to tauba kar aur Allah Taala se bakhshish maang us wastay ke banda jab gunah ka iqraar karta hai aur tauba karta hai to Allah Taala us ko bakhsh deta hai Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni baat mukammal kar chukay to mere aansu bilkul band ho gaye yahan tak ke aik qatra bhi na raha mein ne apne walid se kaha ke Aap meri taraf se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko jawab dein wo bolay ke Allah ki qasam ! mein nahi janta ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko kiya jawab dun (SubhanAllah Allah un ke walid to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke mehbub thay go un ki beti ka muqadma tha lekin Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay dam na maara baawujoodat zaman aawaz niyaamad ke manam) mein ne apni walida se kaha ke tum meri taraf se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko jawab do to wo boli ke Allah ki qasam ! mein nahi jaanti ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko kiya jawab dun aakhir mein ne khud hi kaha aur mein kamsin larki thi mein Quran zyada nahi padhi thi Allah ki qasam ! mujhe ye maloom hai ke tum logon ne us baat ko yahan tak suna hai ke tumharay dil mein jam gayi hai aur tum ne us ko sach samajh liya hai (aur ye Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne ghussa se farmaya warna sach kisi ne nahi samjha tha siwae tohmat karnay walon ke) phir agar tum se kahun ke mein begunah hun aur Allah Taala janta hai ke mein begunah hun to bhi tum mujhe sacha nahi samjho ge aur agar mein us gunah ka i'tiraaf kar lun halanke Allah Taala janta hai ke mein us se paak hun to tum mujhe sacha samjho ge aur mein apni aur tumhari misaal siwa us ke aur koi nahi paati jo Yusuf alaihissalam ke walid (Ya'qoob alaihissalam) ki thi (Aisha Siddiqa raziyallahu anha ko ranj mein un ka naam yaad na aaya to Yusuf alaihissalam ke walid kaha) jab unhon ne kaha ke ” ab sabr hi behtar hai aur tumhari us guftagu par Allah hi ki madad ki zaroorat hai “ (Surah Yusuf) phir mein ne karwat mor li aur mein apne bichhonay par lait rahi aur Allah ki qasam ! mein us waqt jaanti thi ke mein paak hun Allah Taala zaroor meri baraat zaahir karay ga lekin Allah ki qasam ! mujhe ye gumaan na tha ke meri shaan mein Quran utray ga jo (qayamat tak) padha jaye ga kyunke meri shaan khud mere gumaan mein us laiq na thi ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu izzat aur buzrugi wala mere muqadma mein kalaam karay ga aur kalaam bhi aisa ke jo padha jaye albatta mujhe ye umeed thi ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khwab mein koi aisa mazmoon dekhein ge jis se Allah Taala meri paakeezgi zaahir kar de ga Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni jagah se nahi uthay thay aur na ghar walon mein se koi bahar gaya tha ke Allah Taala ne apne paighambar sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi bheji aur Quran utara Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko wahi ki sakhti maloom honay lagi yahan tak ke sardi ke dinon mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke jism mubarak par se us kalaam ki sakhti ki wajah se jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par utra mauti ki tarah pasinay ke qatray tapaknay lagay (us liye ke baray shahinshah ka kalaam tha) jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ye haalat jati rahi (yani wahi khatm ho chuki) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hansnay lagay aur awwal Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne munh se ye kalima nikala aur farmaya ke Ae Aisha ! khush ho ja Allah Taala ne tujhe begunah aur paak farmaya hai meri walida ne kaha ke uth aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki tareef kar (aur shukr kar) mein ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf na uthon gi aur na kisi ki tareef karun gi siwa Allah Taala ke ke usi ne meri paakdaamni utari Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Allah Taala ne utara ke ” beshak jo log buhtaan ghar laaye hain wo tum hi mein se aik giroh hain us (waaqee) ko apne liye shar (bura) na samjho balke tumharay liye khair (acha) hi hai “ aakhir tak das aayaton ko Allah Taala ne meri paakdaamni ke liye utara Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ne jo Mistah ki qareebi rishta daari ghurbat ki wajah se us par kharch kiya kartay thay kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! jab us ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ki nisbat aisa kaha to ab mein us ko kuch na dun ga Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke ” tum mein se jo log fazl aur maqdirat walay hain wo us baat ki qasam na kha baithein ke wo kuch (na) dein ge apne rishta daaron aur masaakeen aur Allah ki raah mein hijrat karnay walon ko kiya tum nahi chahtay ke Allah Taala tumhein maaf karay aur Allah Taala Ghafoor Raheem hai “ Hibban bin Musa ne kaha ke Abdullah bin mubarak ne kaha ke ye aayat Allah ki kitab mein bari umeed ki hai (kyunke us mein Allah Taala ne rishta daaron ke saath sulook karnay mein bakhshish ka waada kiya hai) Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein ye chahta hun ke Allah mujhe bakhshay phir Mistah ko jo kuch diya kartay thay wo jaari kar diya aur kaha ke mein kabhi band na karun ga Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Umm ul-Momineen Zainab bint Jahsh raziyallahu anha se bhi mere baaray mein poocha ke wo kiya jaanti hain ya unhon ne kiya dekha hai to unhon ne kaha (halanke wo saukan thin) ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein apne kaan aur aankh ki ehtiyaat rakhti hun (yani bin sunay koi baat nahi kehti aur na bin dekhay ko dekhi hui kehti hun) mein to Aisha ko naik hi samajhti hun Aisha Siddiqa raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke Zainab raziyallahu anha hi aik biwi thin jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj mein se mere muqaabil ki thin aur Allah Taala ne un ko un ki parhezgaari ki wajah se us tohmat se bachaya aur un ki behan Hamna bint Jahsh ne behan ke liye ta'assub kiya aur un ke liye larein to jo log tabah hue un mein wo bhi thin (yani tohmat mein shareek thin) Zuhri ne kaha ke to un logon ka ye aakhir haal hai jo ham tak pahuncha"
"2154","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` log aik aadmi par Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki haram se (yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki Umm walad londi) ko tohmat lagatay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya ke ja aur us shakhs ki gardan maar (shayad wo munafiq ho ga ya kisi aur wajah se qatl ke laiq ho ga) Ali (raziyallahu anhu) us ke paas gaye dekha to wo thandak ke liye aik kunwein mein ghusl kar raha hai Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne us se kaha ke nikal us ne apna haath Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ke haath mein diya unhon ne us ko bahar nikala to dekha ke us ka uzw tanaasul kata hua hai Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne us ko qatl na kiya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aa kar arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! wo to majboob hai (yani zikr kata hua) us ka zikr hi nahi (to Ali (raziyallahu anhu) yehi samjhay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne zina ke khayal se us ke qatl ka hukm diya hai us wastay unhon ne qatl na kiya aur shayad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko wahi se maloom ho gaya ho ga ke wo qatl na kiya jaye ga lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qatl ka hukm diya taake us ka haal zaahir ho jaye aur log apni tohmat par naadim hun aur un ka jhoot khul jaye)"
"2155","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Abdullah bin Abu bin Salol ki Musaika aur Umaima naami do londiaan thin wo donon ko zina par majboor karta tha unhon ne us ki shikayat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ki tab ye aayat naazil ke ” aur apni londion ko zinaakaari par majboor na karo agar wo khud paakdaaman rehna chahti hun .... beshak Allah Taala Ghafoor Raheem hai “ tak"
"2156","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` mushrikon mein se chand logon ne (shirk ki haalat mein) bohat khoon kiye thay aur bohat zina kiya tha phir wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur arz kiya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jo farmatay hain aur jis raah ki taraf bilatay hain wo achi hai aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein batlayein ke kiya wo hamaray guzishta gunaahon ka kaffara hai (agar kaffara hai to ham Islam laayein ge) tab ye aayat naazil ke ” jo log Allah ke saath doosray maboodon ko nahi pukaartay aur jis jaan ka maarna Allah Taala ne haraam kiya hai us ko nahi maartay magar kisi haq ke badlay aur zina nahi kartay aur jo koi un kaamon ko (yani khoon aur zina aur shirk) karay to wo badla paye ga aur us ko qayamat ke din dardnaak azaab ho ga aur wo hamesha usi azaab mein zillat se rahay ga lekin jo koi iman laya aur us ne tauba ki aur naik kaam kiye to us ki buraiyan mit kar neki ho jayein gi aur Allah Taala meharban hai aur bakhshnay wala hai “ (aur Allah Taala ne un logon ko batla diya ke tum Islam lao tumharay aglay sab gunah shirk ke zamanay ke maaf ho jayein ge) aur ye aayat naazil ke ” Ae mere bando ! jinhon ne gunah kiye hain Allah ki rehmat se naaumeed mat ho ........ “ poori aayat"
"2157","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala farmata hai ke mein ne apne naik bandon ke liye wo tayyar kiya hai jo kisi aankh ne nahi dekha aur na kisi kaan ne suna hai aur kisi aadmi ke dil par us ka khayal bhi nahi guzra ye sab nematein mein ne bana rakhi hain un ko chhoro jo Allah ne tumhein batlaya (yani jo nematein aur lazzatein maloom hain wo kaisi umda hain aur bhali hain to jannat ki nemat aur lazzat jis ka ilm Allah Taala ne nahi diya wo kaisi hun gi) phir Aap ne ye aayat padhi ke ” koi nahi janta jo un ki aankhon ki thandak ke liye chhupaya gaya hai “ (jannat mein)"
"2158","[AI-translation] ´Abu bin Ka'b raziyallahu anhu Allah Taala ke us` qaul ” ham un ko chota azaab dein ge .... “ ke baaray mein kehtay hain ke us se muraad duniya ki takaaleef hain aur Room aur batsha (ya dukhaan) aur Shuba ko shak hai ke batsha kaha ya ke dukhaan kaha"
"2159","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Allah Taala ke` qaul ” jab wo tum par aaye tumharay upar se neechay se aur jab aankhein phir gayein aur dil halaq tak aa gaye “ ke baaray mein kehti hain ke ye ghazwa Khandaq ke mutaliq naazil (us din Musalmanon par nihayat sakhti thi Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ham ne us din kafiron par aik lashkar bheja jin ko tum ne nahi dekha aur taiz hua)"
"2160","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se Allah Taala ke qaul ” sooraj apne theharnay ki jagah par chala ja raha hai “ ke baaray mein poocha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ke theharnay ki jagah arsh ke neechay hai"
"2161","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` aik Yahudi aalim Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! ya Ae Abul Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! Allah Taala qayamat ke din aasmanon ko aik ungli par utha le ga aur zameenon ko aik ungli par aur paharon aur darakhton ko aik ungli par aur pani aur namnaak zameen ko aik ungli par aur tamam makhlooq ko aik ungli par phir un ko hilaye ga aur kahay ga ke mein baadshah hun mein baadshah hun ye sun kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam taajjub se hansay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us aalim ke kalaam ki tasdeeq ki phir ye aayat padhi ” unhon ne Allah ki qadar nahi ki jaisay us ki qadar karni chahiye thi aur qayamat ke din us ki saari zameen us ki aik mutthi mein ho gi aur us ke daayein haath mein aasmaan liptay hun ge wo paak hai aur mushrikon ke shirk se buland hai “"
"2162","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Masud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` bait Allah ke paas teen aadmi ikathay hue jin mein se do Quraish ke thay aur aik Saqeef ka ya do Saqeef ke thay aur aik Quraish ka tha un ke dilon mein samajh kam thi aur un ke paiton mein charbi bohat thi (us se maloom hua ke motapay ke saath daanayi kam hoti hai) un mein se aik shakhs bola ke tum kiya samajhtay ho jo ham kehtay hain kiya Allah Taala sunta hai doosra bola ke agar ham ba-aawaaz buland pukaarein ge to sunay ga aur chupkay se bolein ge to nahi sunay ga teesra bola ke agar ba-aawaaz buland pukaarnay par sunta hai to aahista bolnay par bhi sunay ga tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ” tum us liye nahi chhupatay thay ke tumharay kaan aankhein aur tumhari khaalein tum par gawahi dein gi .... “ poori aayat (lekin tum ne ye khayal kiya ke bohat se kaam jo tum kartay ho Allah nahi janta)"
"2163","[AI-translation] ´Masrooq kehtay hain ke` ham Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ke paas baithay thay aur wo hamaray darmiyan laitay hue thay ke aik shakhs aaya aur bola ke Ae Abu Abdur Rahman ! aik qissa ko Kunda ke darwazon par bayan karta hai aur kehta hai ke Quran mein jo dhuwein ki aayat hai ye dhoaan aanay wala hai aur kafiron ka saans rok de ga aur Musalmanon ko us se zukaam ki kaifiyat paida ho jaye gi ye sun kar Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ghussay mein baith gaye aur kaha ke Ae logon ! Allah se daro tum mein se jo koi baat janta hai us ko kahay aur jo nahi janta to yun kahay ke Allah Taala khoob janta hai kyunke ilm ki baat yehi hai ke jo baat tum mein se koi na janta ho us ke liye ” Allah a'lam “ kahay Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne apne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se farmaya ke ” to Ae Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! keh ke mein kuch mazdoori nahi maangta aur na mein takalluf karta hun “ (raziyallahu anhu : 76) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jab logon ki kaifiyat dekhi ke wo samajhanay se nahi maantay to farmaya ke Ae Allah ! un par saat baras ka qaht bhej jaisay Yusuf alaihissalam ke door mein saat baras tak qaht hua tha aakhir Quraish par qaht para jo har cheez ko kha gaya yahan tak ke unhon ne bhook ke maaray kha lun aur murdaar ko bhi kha liya aur un mein se aik shakhs aasmaan ko dekhta to dhuwein ki tarah maloom hota phir Sufyan raziyallahu anhu Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ! tum to Allah Taala ki itaat ka hukm kartay ho aur naata jornay ka hukm kartay ho aur tumhari qaum to tabah ho gayi un ke liye Allah Taala se dua karo Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ” us din ka intezar kar jab aasmaan se khullam khula dhoaan uthay ga jo logon ko dhaank le ga ye dukh ka azaab hai ........ yahan tak ke farmaya ke ham azaab ko mauqoof karnay walay hain tehqeeq tum phir kufr karnay walay ho “ agar us aayat mein aakhirat ka azaab muraad hai to wo kahein mauqoof hota hai phir Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” jis din ham bari pakar pakarein ge ham badla lein ge “ to us pakar se muraad Badr ki pakar hai aur ye nishaniaan yani dhoaan aur pakar aur lizaam aur Room ki nishaniaan to guzar chukein hain"
"2164","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` paanch nishaniaan to guzar chukein hain aur wo dukhaan lizaam Room batsha aur qamar (yani shaqq al-Qamar) hain"
"2165","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Makka ke usi musallah aadmi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par Taneem ke pahar se utray wo dhoka aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ghaflat ki haalat mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur sahaba kiraam par (hamla karna chahtay thay) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko pakar liya lekin qatl nahi kiya tab Allah Taala ne us aayat ko utara ke ” yani wo Allah hai jis ne un ke haathon ko tum se roka (aur un ka fareb kuch na chala) aur tumharay haathon se un ko roka (yani tum ne un ko qatl na kiya) Makka ki sarhad mein un par fatah ho janay ke baad"
"2166","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke jab ye aayat ” Ae iman walo ! apni aawazein Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aawaz se buland mat karo ........ aakhir tak “ naazil hui to saabit bin Qais bin Shammaas raziyallahu anhu apne ghar mein baith rahay aur kehnay lagay ke mein to jahannami hun (kyunke un ki aawaz bohat buland thi aur wo Ansaar ke khateeb thay us liye wo darr gaye) aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aana chhor diya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Sa'd bin Muaz raziyallahu anhu se poocha ke Ae Amr ! saabit ka kiya haal hai kiya beemar ho gaya hai Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke wo mera hamsaya hai mein nahi janta ke wo beemar hai phir raziyallahu anhu Sa'd saabit raziyallahu anhu ke paas aaye aur un se bayan kiya ke jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya tha to saabit raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ye aayat naazil aur tum jantay ho ke meri aawaz Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par oonchi hai (us liye) mein to jahannami hun phir Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ye bayan kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi balke wo jinti hai"
"2167","[AI-translation] ´Abdul Wahhaab bin Ata` Allah Taala ke farman ((yaum naqool lijahannam ....)) al-aaya ke mutaliq Sa'eed se wo Qatada se aur wo Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se aur wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : barabar jahannam mein log daalay jatay rahein ge aur wo yehi kahay gi ke ” kuch aur hai “ yahan tak ke Allah Taala izzat wala apna qadam us mein rakh de ga tab us ka baaz hissa baaz mein simat jaye ga aur kehnay lagay gi ke bas bas teri izzat aur karam ki qasam aur barabar jannat mein jagah khaali rahay gi yahan tak ke Allah Taala us ke liye aik makhlooq ko paida karay ga aur us ko us jagah mein rakhay ga"
"2168","[AI-translation] ´Ishaq kehtay hain ke` mein ne aik aadmi ko dekha ke us ne Aswad bin Yazid se poocha aur wo masjid mein Quran padhaya kartay thay ke tum ((muddakir)) mein daal padhtay ho ya zaal unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ko suna wo keh rahay thay ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ((fahal Nabi muddakir)) daal se padhtay hue suna hai (yani jis mein nuqta nahi hota)"
"2169","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : farishtay noor se binaye gaye jin aag ki lo se aur Adam alaihissalam us se jo Quran mein bayan hua hai (yani mitti se)"
"2170","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Masud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab se ham Musalman hue us waqt se le kar us aayat ” kiya wo waqt nahi aaya jab Musalmanon ke dil Allah ke zikr ke liye laraz jayein “ ke utarnay ke waqt tak jis mein Allah Taala ne ham par itaab kiya ho chaar baras ka arsa guzra"
"2171","[AI-translation] ´Urwa kehtay hain ke` mujh se Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Ae mere bhaanjay ! logon ko hukm hua tha ke wo sahaba ke liye bakhshish maangein lekin unhon ne un ko bura kaha"
"2172","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jinnaat ko Quran nahi sunaya aur un ko dekha bhi nahi waqia ye hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne ashaab ke saath us zamana mein Ukaaz ke bazaar gaye jab ke shaitaanon par aasmaani darwazay band ho gaye thay aur un par aag ke sholay barasaye ja rahay thay Chunanche shaitaanon ke aik giroh ne apne logon mein ja kar kaha ke hamara aasmaan par jana band ho gaya aur ham par aag ke sholay barasnay lagay hain unhon ne kaha ke us ka sabab zaroor koi naya amr hai to mashriq o Maghrib ki taraf phir kar khabar lo aur dekho ke kiya wajah hai jo aasmaan ki khabarein aana band ho gayein wo zameen mein mashriq o Maghrib ki taraf phirnay lagay un mein se kuch log Tihaama (mulk Hijaaz) ki taraf Ukaaz ke bazaar ko janay ke liye aaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us waqt (muqaam) Nakhl mein apne ashaab ko Fajr ki namaz padha rahay thay jab unhon ne Quran suna to idhar kaan laga diye aur kehnay lagay ke aasmaan ki khabarein mauqoof honay ka yehi sabab hai phir wo apni qaum ke paas laut kar gaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae hamari qaum ke logon ! ” ham ne aik ajab Quran suna hai jo sachi raah ki taraf le jata hai pas ham us par iman laaye aur ham kabhi Allah ke saath shareek na karein ge “ tab Allah Taala ne Surah al-Jinn apne paighambar sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par utari ke ” Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) keh do ke meri taraf wahi ki gayi ke jinon ki aik jamaat ne Quran suna “"
"2173","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma)` Allah Taala ke qaul ’ apni zubaan ko jaldi ke saath yaad karnay ke liye na hilayie “ ke baaray mein kehtay hain ke us ka waqia ye hai ke nuzool Quran Kareem ke waqt Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tangi mehsoos kartay thay us liye apne honton ko harkat detay thay Sa'eed ne kaha ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne mujh se kaha ke mein tumharay liye hont hilata hun jaisay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hont hilatay thay pas Sa'eed ne kaha ke jis tarah Ibn Abbas apne hont hila rahay thay mein bhi usi tarah apne hont hilata hun tab Allah Taala ne ye hukm naazil farmaya ke ” Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jaldi se yaad karnay ke liye apni zubaan na hilayie balke tehqeeq us ka ikaththa karna aur padhana hamaray zimma hai “ yani Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke seena mein jama karna ke phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ko padhein (yani nuzool wahi ke waqt) Aap khamoshi aur ghaur se sunein phir usay padhana hamaray zimma hai us hukm ilaahi ke baad jab Jibrail wahi laatay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ke alfaaz ba khamoshi suntay rehtay aur un ki rawaangi ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wohi alfaaz dohra detay jo Jibrail alaihissalam keh jatay thay"
"2174","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us aayat ” jis din log Rab aalim ke saamnay kharay hun ge “ ki tafseer mein farmaya ke baaz log apne pasinay mein doobe kharay hun ge jo donon kaanon ke nisf tak ho ga"
"2175","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jis shakhs se qayamat ke din hisab ho ga us ko azaab ho ga mein ne kaha ke Allah Taala to farmata hai ” phir anqareeb hisab kiya jaye ga aasani se aur wo apne ghar walon mein khush ho kar laut jaye ga “ to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye hisab o kitab nahi hai ye to sirf aamaal ki peshi hai jis se qayamat ke din hisab mein tafteesh ki gayi us ko azaab ho ga"
"2176","[AI-translation] ´Alqama raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` ham shaam ko gaye to Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu hamaray paas aaye aur kaha ke tum mein koi Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ki qiraat padhnay wala hai mein ne kaha ke haan ! mein hun unhon ne kaha ke tum us aayat ((wallail iza yaghsha)) ko kaisay padhtay ho mein ne kaha ke Abdullah raziyallahu anhu us tarah padhtay thay ((wallail iza yaghsha waz-zakar wal-unsa)) unhon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein ne bhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko yunhi padhtay suna hai aur yahan ke log chahtay hain ke mein padhun ke ((wa ma khalaq az-zakar wal-unsa)) to mein un ki nahi maanta"
"2177","[AI-translation] ´Aswad bin Qais kehtay hain ke` mein ne Jundub bin Abu Sufyan raziyallahu anhu se suna wo kehtay thay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam beemar ho gaye to do teen raat tak nahi uthay phir aik aurat (Aawraa bint Harb Sufyan ki behan Abu Lahab ki biwi hammaala al-hatab) aayi aur kehnay lagi ke Ae Muhammad ! mein samajhti hun ke tumharay shaitaan ne tumhein chhor diya hai (ye us shaitaanni ne hansi se kaha) kyunke mein dekhti hun ke do teen raat se tumharay paas nahi aaya tab Allah Taala ne ye surat utari ” qasam hai roz roshan ki aur raat ki jab ke wo sukoon ke saath chha jaye tumharay Rab ne na tumhein chhora hai aur na wo naraaz hua hai “"
"2178","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Shakheer raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ye padh rahay thay ke ” halaakat mein daal diya tumhein zyada se zyada (maal) hasil karnay (ki khwahish) ne “ Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aadmi kehta hai ke mera maal mera maal aur Ae aadmi ! tera maal kiya hai tera maal wohi hai jo to ne khaya aur fana kiya ya pehna aur puraana kiya ya sadqa diya aur jaari kiya (qayamat ke liye rawana kiya)"
"2179","[AI-translation] ´Ubaidullah bin Utba raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mujh se Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke to janta hai ke Quran ki yakbaargi mukammal naazil honay wali aakhri surat kaun si hai mein ne kaha ke haan ! wo ye surat ” jab Allah Taala ki madad aa jaye aur fatah aa jaye “ hai unhon ne kaha ke to ne sach kaha"
